summary.label:
My Expenses is a free application for manage your monthly bills (revenues and expenses).

With simple and intuitive interface the application helps you to keep the bills up to date!

- Log in with Google or Facebook, or register with username and password if you prefer;
- Register single or recurring bills (monthly, half-yearly or annually);
- Automatic backup in the cloud;
- Works offline;
- Dark mode.

Install My Expenses now and keep all your bills up to date!

